_pdbx_database_related.db_name        BMRB 
_pdbx_database_related.details        
;Cross-Stacking-Stabilized Intra-Locked RNA G-Quadruplex; eight identical RNA strands (A through H) assemble into stacked G-quadruplets. Consequently, the chemical shifts for each strand are identical. The chemical shift data we provide based on strand H fully represents the NMR identification for the entire assembly.
;
_pdbx_database_related.db_id          36780 
_pdbx_database_related.content_type   unspecified 
